        Prompt library<a href="#prompts" class="anchor-link" aria-label="Copy link to section" set:html={anchorSvg}></a>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-oz-neutral-700 mb-6">
        Thirty prompts, five per module, written to make something teach you rather than
